      <title>随着美国战争弹药的减少，伊朗如何调整袭击</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/11/us/politics/iran-military-base-attacks-us-munitions.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[伊朗在约旦发动的空袭导致三名美国士兵死亡，这表明在五角大楼拦截弹不足的情况下，伊朗的作战能力发展得有多快。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/11/us/politics/iran-military-base-attacks-us-munitions.html</guid>
